  <main class="wrap">
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="card intro">
        <div class="eyebrow">Damodaran-Style Financial Analyst System</div>
        <h1>Founder-spec financial analyst to Gamma-ready deck.</h1>
        <p>This production portal now follows the founder's required input order: first company and ticker, then executive, industry, and expert perspective. The system only starts once required inputs are present.</p>
        <div class="pillrow">
          <span class="pill">Question-gated inputs</span>
          <span class="pill">SEC EDGAR first</span>
          <span class="pill">No paid financial APIs</span>
          <span class="pill">N/A for missing data</span>
          <span class="pill">Gamma-ready output</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <form id="dfaForm">
          <div id="step1" class="step show">
            <div class="step-title">Question 1: What is the company name you want analyzed, and ticker symbol if public?</div>
            <div>
              <label>Company name</label>
              <input name="company_name" placeholder="Example: Apple Inc." required />
            </div>
            <div>
              <label>Ticker symbol if public</label>
              <input name="ticker" placeholder="Example: AAPL" />
            </div>
            <button id="nextBtn" type="button">Continue to Question 2</button>
          </div>
          <div id="step2" class="step">
            <div class="step-title">Question 2: Which executive, industry, and expert perspective should be blended with Damodaran?</div>
            <div class="grid2">
              <div>
                <label>C-level executive</label>
                <select name="exec_type" required>
                  <option value="">Choose executive</option>
                  <option>CFO</option><option>CIO</option><option>CEO</option><option>COO</option><option>CDO</option><option>CISO</option><option>Board</option><option>Investor</option>
                </select>
              </div>
              <div>
                <label>Industry</label>
                <input name="industry" placeholder="Example: Technology, SaaS, Banking, Retail" required />
              </div>
            </div>
            <div>
              <label>Industry expert to blend</label>
              <input name="expert_pref" placeholder="Write an expert name or type: pick for me" required />
            </div>
